## 3. Practice Drills

1. Inspect the loaded profile in `/etc/apparmor.d/k8s-deny-write`.
2. Verify it is loaded in the kernel using `sudo aa-status | grep k8s-deny-write`.
3. Apply `01-pod-unconfined.yaml` and verify it can write to `/tmp/write-test.txt`.
4. Apply `02-pod-deny-write.yaml` and inspect pod logs to observe `Permission denied`.
5. Run the automated test script:

```bash
./test-apparmor-drills.sh
```
